OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Fblustery showers continue this evening
OL,7,Fand through tonight, along with a few
OL,8,Fclear intervals. Strong southwesterly
OL,9,Fwinds, with gales at first in the
OL,10,Fnorth.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,13,Fand further showers, most frequent in
OL,14,Fwest but becoming more scattered in
OL,15,Fthe afternoon as winds continue to
OL,16,Fease down.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
