OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,7,Fmainly cloudy with a few light
OL,8,Fshowers. Some sunshine around too. A
OL,9,Fdry start Friday then rain spreading
OL,10,Ffrom west. Rain easing later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
